{"id":"Wa61a6ce802167d61b2dc37f6","zh":"损伤刚度矩阵","en":"","name":"损伤刚度矩阵","language":"zh","domain":"铁路动力学、信号与建模方法","concept_id":"C02685dbdb9ab1d0be5d0","families":[],"definition_zh":"随轨道混凝土或砂浆疲劳损伤状态变化而更新的结构刚度矩阵。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":"以原系统矩阵扣除局部原矩阵、加入损伤矩阵的方式更新。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wa61a6ce802167d61b2dc37f6","text":"损伤刚度矩阵","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S4c362dcdf04a00dfd3a6","source_id":"P123","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"在TTS 统一分析模型中,混凝土结构主要由板单元及空间等参单元模拟 [7],其损伤刚度矩阵及更新方法如下。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"Sce66b7c35f44acc0ee2f","source_id":"P123","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"混凝土结构的疲劳损伤刚度矩阵具有时变性, 可采用循环计算方法 [8],根据列车时变位置,将轨道-基础结构系统矩阵的前、后相应边界进行空间截断,以提高计算效率。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P123":{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W4ebf6d11fdbf699cde37dc33","name":"damage-dependent stiffness matrix","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W4ebf6d11fdbf699cde37dc33","name":"damage-dependent stiffness matrix","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W4ebf6d11fdbf699cde37dc33","name":"damage-dependent stiffness matrix","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P123","title":